				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Notes to Financial Statements (Unaudited)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;For the Quarter Ended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;31, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Golden Pass Pipeline LLC&amp;#x2019;s accounting policies, regulatory matters, and financial disclosures remain consistent with those presented in its FERC Form No. 2 for the year ended December 31, 2025. Refer to the annual filing for detailed notes and disclosures.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
